===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ser- (bind)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|sort}}, {{m|enm|soort}}, {{m|enm|sorte}} (cognate {{cog|nl|soort}}, {{cog|de|Sorte}}, {{cog|da|sort}}, {{cog|sv|sort}}), borrowed from {{der|en|fro|sorte||class, kind}}, from {{der|en|la|sortem}}, accusative form of {{m|la|sors||lot, fate, share, rank, category}}.

